# Deadcode ignore patterns
# Patterns to exclude from deadcode analysis
# See: https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/joeycumines/simple-command-output-filter

# DO NOT ADD IGNORES TO THIS FILE WITH THE INTENT OF "WIRING THEM UP LATER"

# Test-only support packages: their accessors are exercised exclusively by
# test files, so deadcode (which analyzes production entry points) reports
# them as unreachable.
internal/tui/tuitest/helper.go:*
internal/transcode/testcorpus/*

# Test-only functions in main and related modules: production entry points
# reference them through CLI parsing interfaces (flag.Value) that deadcode does
# not trace through interface satisfaction.
main.go:*
internal/proxy/proxy.go:*
internal/transcode/losses.go:*
